### Adesso World League — Draw API
### docker compose up --build -d  ile @host = http://localhost:8080
### dotnet run --project src/AdessoLeague.Api  ile @host = http://localhost:5154

@host = http://localhost:8080
@drawId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###############################################################################
# Kura oluşturma
###############################################################################

### 8 gruba kura — 8 grup x 4 takım, her grupta 4 farklı ülke
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupCount": 8, "drawnBy": { "firstName": "Oğuzhan", "lastName": "Ünsal" } }

### 4 gruba kura — 4 grup x 8 takım, her grupta 8 ülkenin hepsi
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupCount": 4, "drawnBy": { "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Çelik" } }

### Correlation id göndererek — aynı değer yanıt başlığında ve loglarda görünür
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: my-trace-0001

{ "groupCount": 8, "drawnBy": { "firstName": "Oğuzhan", "lastName": "Ünsal" } }

###############################################################################
# Doğrulama hataları — hepsi RFC 7807 ProblemDetails döner
###############################################################################

### Geçersiz grup sayısı -> 400, errors.GroupCount
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupCount": 5, "drawnBy": { "firstName": "Oğuzhan", "lastName": "Ünsal" } }

### Boş ad -> 400, errors.FirstName
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupCount": 8, "drawnBy": { "firstName": "   ", "lastName": "Ünsal" } }

### 100 karakteri aşan soyad -> 400, errors.LastName
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupCount": 8, "drawnBy": { "firstName": "Oğuzhan", "lastName": "UzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyadUzunSoyad" } }

### drawnBy alanı hiç yok -> 400 (model binding)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupCount": 8 }

###############################################################################
# Sorgular
###############################################################################

### Tek kura — {{drawId}} yerine POST yanıtındaki id'yi yaz
GET {{host}}/api/v1/draws/{{drawId}}

### Bilinmeyen id -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/v1/draws/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Kura geçmişi — varsayılan sayfalama (pageSize 20)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/draws

### Kura geçmişi — sayfalı, createdAtUtc azalan
GET {{host}}/api/v1/draws?page=1&pageSize=5

### pageSize sınırı aşıldı -> 400, errors.PageSize
GET {{host}}/api/v1/draws?page=1&pageSize=101

### page 1'den küçük -> 400, errors.Page
GET {{host}}/api/v1/draws?page=0&pageSize=10

###############################################################################
# Operasyon
###############################################################################

### Süreç ayakta mı
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Bağımlılıklar hazır mı (PostgreSQL)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI dokümanı (yalnızca Development)
GET {{host}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
